  "title": "Application Services Brings the “Chatter” to Cortina",
  "summary": "According to my research, “chatter” is slang used by skiers to describe going fast. Having been born and raised in a part of the world where I can count on one hand the number of times I’ve seen snow, I’ll have to defer to experts like Diego Devalle to enlighten me on whether or not this is true. (If you haven’t already done so, you can read all about his love for skiing and Cortina here.)",
